<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361536" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute><lb/><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> <choice><sic>e</sic><corr>et</corr></choice> <abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Viro <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolao Bernoull<subst><del>o</del><add><choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></add></subst></rs>
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-102552517">Petrus <abbr>Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> Michelotti</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Adeo tarde redii domum <date when="1718-12-17">die sabati</date> ut impossibile
      <lb/>fuerit inclusam <rs type="letter">epistolam</rs> mittere <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-3169070">Romam</rs> ad <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1156417392">Al<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bertum Fridericum Gutt</rs>. Eam tamen mittam die
      <lb/>proxime ventura <date when="1718-12-17">sabati</date>. Quod perseveres irasci et
      <lb/>dolere pro re de qua Te certiorem feci ubi fateor
      <lb/>te summam habere rationem ita te hortor ut
      <lb/>irasci desinas. C<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terum Tibi nota haud est potentia
      <lb/><choice><sic><choice><orig><g ref="#AE">Æ</g></orig><reg>Ae</reg></choice>quitis</sic><corr>Equitis</corr></choice> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1111043582">M.</rs> Is habet plurimos sibi et amicitia
      <lb/>et affinitate conjunctos adeo ut procul dubio
      <lb/><choice><sic>maximo</sic><corr>maxima</corr></choice> votorum pars pro eo fuisset in <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-10092421-9">Senatu</rs>
      <lb/>contra <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120379260">Scheuchzerum</rs>, pro quo rogatus ut nullam
      <lb/>adduceret oppositionem nunquam pati <unclear>v</unclear>oluit
      <lb/>ut <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120379260">Scheuchzerus</rs> proponeretur sine <subst><del>sua</del><add>ejus</add></subst> valida
      <lb/>oppositione semperque dixit se nullam habe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re oppositionem pro <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118607308"><abbr>Jo.</abbr> Jacobo Scheuchzero</rs>
      <lb/>si <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-3171728">Patavium</rs> ille venire vellet ad Docendum
      <lb/>Botanicen. Noluerunt <abbr>Ill.</abbr> et <abbr>Exc.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089922930 pers_DE-588-1089586140 pers_DE-588-1111043582" type="person">Moderatores</rs> expo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nere<del> <gap/></del> eorum existimationem. Etenim magnum
      <lb/>fuisset eorum dedecus si (uti crediderunt) <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120379260">Scheuchz<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>eri</rs> Pars cecidisset in <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-10092421-9">Senatu</rs>. Si <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118607308"><abbr>Jo.</abbr> Jacobus<del> Scheuch</del>
      <lb/>Scheuchzerus</rs> venire vult, procul dubio ille
<pb facs="1361538" n="2"/>
      <lb/>promovebitur. Quare scribe ad illum de hac
      <lb/>re et intellige ejus voluntatem. Illum non voca<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>runt quia credunt se nolle venire pro sti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pendio tam parvo.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Amicissime,
      <lb/>et igne dissolve has meas litteras. Salutem
      <lb/><subst><del>P</del><add>p</add></subst>lurimam dicito <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Marchioni <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-11887733X">Poleno</rs></salute>
      <lb/>meo nomine.<dateline>Dabam <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1718-12-19"><choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> 19 <abbr>X.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi></abbr>
      <lb/>1718</date><supplied>.</supplied></dateline></closer><note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> den <date when="1718-12-20">20ten</date></foreign></note>
</div>
